@startuml deal-lifecycle-state
title WF-02 | Cooperation Deal Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam stateBackgroundColor white
skinparam noteBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
top to bottom direction

state CONTACTED
state NEGOTIATING
state CONFIRMED
state DECLINED
state CANCELLED

[*] --> CONTACTED : / create Deal and channel members
CONTACTED --> NEGOTIATING : propose\n[eligible members and valid terms (BR-54/71)]\n/ append OFFER revision
NEGOTIATING --> NEGOTIATING : propose or counter\n[valid terms and eligible actor (BR-54/71)]\n/ append revision; clear prior acceptance and invalidate invitation
NEGOTIATING --> NEGOTIATING : accept\n[eligible Creator accepts current OFFER (BR-55)]\n/ record accepted revision
NEGOTIATING --> CONFIRMED : confirm\n[current acceptance or valid external evidence;\nCampaign, channel and budget checks pass (BR-55/56/71)]\n/ atomically create PLANNED Collaboration
NEGOTIATING --> DECLINED : decline\n[eligible Creator responds to current Deal]\n/ invalidate invitation and record decline

CONTACTED --> CANCELLED : cancel\n[authorized Brand and current revision]\n/ deactivate members
NEGOTIATING --> CANCELLED : cancel\n[authorized Brand and current revision]\n/ deactivate members and invalidate invitation
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancel\n[authorized Brand, current revision and Collaboration PLANNED]\n/ cancel Collaboration and deactivate members
DECLINED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of CONFIRMED
  Collaboration start changes Collaboration status.
  The Deal stays CONFIRMED.
end note
note left of CONTACTED
  Deal status is stored in cooperation_deal.status.
  CRM stage belongs to the separate Relationship.
  New Deal writes validate the expected revision.
end note
@enduml
